; Test: Swap/Replace pattern (remove A, add B)
; ==============================================
;
; Demonstrates: Using (+ ...) and (- ...) together to swap facts
; Based on test from kernel/src/main.rs:1368

; Setup
A

; Test: Remove A, add B
(exec a
  (, A)
  (O (- A)
     (+ B)))

; Expected output:
; B
;
; The fact A is removed and B is added in one atomic step.
; This is the fundamental swap/replace pattern.
